# What never goes into the package.
#
# The board runs on a few hundred megabytes of node packages, which is more than belongs
# in an extension, so they are fetched on the machine that needs them the first time it
# is used. Everything else here is either a build output or something only this repo
# cares about.

app/node_modules/**
app/dist/**
**/node_modules/**
**/.DS_Store
**/*.vsix
.vscode/**
.gitignore
